<title>USA: Manchester sees Q2 Jan 31 net $0.09-$0.10.</title>
<headline>Manchester sees Q2 Jan 31 net $0.09-$0.10.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manchester Equipment Co Inc said on Thursday its preliminary estimates for second-quarter results are lower than analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>The company expects to report revenues in the $44 million to $45 million range, with net income of $700,000 to $750,000, or $0.09 or $0.10 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it expects six-month revenues to be ahead of those for the same period a year ago.</p>
